@moyu-good/dsh-lark-bridge README · 🧩 Extend it：1. **Grafted channel, not re-integration** — the bridge only normalizes messages; every capability comes from official opt-in dsh plugin families composed in your profile. Zero bridge code = zero upgrade cost when upstream ships features.
2. **Everything through host service contracts** — `agents`, `agentPresets`, `approval`, `goals`, `settings`… self-contained against published packages only.
3. **Every change archives a design card first** — see [`docs/design/`](docs/design/README.md).
